
<p>Mark Simonson:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Just by coincidence, I discovered a copy of U&amp;lc magazine in the
graphics classroom. U&amp;lc was published by ITC, the International
Typeface Corporation, a typeface publisher, and the designer and
editor was the legendary Herb Lubalin. I’d never seen such
beautiful typography and design. It was a motherlode for an
aspiring typophile like me. [...]</p>

<p>I decided right then that someday, somehow, I wanted to design
typefaces.</p>
</blockquote>

